  60:   `ToggleQuoteCommand`.
  61:   Lists use the shared `BlockAttributes.listType/checked/indent` model:
  62:   unordered (`listType == null`), ordered (`'ordered'`), and task
  63:   (`'task'` + `checked`).
  64:   Code blocks use `CodeBlockNode.language` plus command-backed line
  65:   indent/outdent so toolbar and Tab edits enter undo/redo.
  66:   Callouts use command-backed variant/title/icon updates so toolbar or business
