  86: ## Controller (tier 1 / tier 2)
  87: 
  88: `WenzRichTextController extends ChangeNotifier` — the integration surface.
  89: 
  90: Construction:
  91: 
  92: ```dart
  93: final controller = WenzRichTextController(
  94:   document: doc,                 // optional; defaults to an empty doc
  95:   selection: selection,          // optional
  96:   richTextJsonCodec: RichTextJsonCodec(migrations: registry),  // optional override
  97:   clipboardService: ClipboardService(),                        // optional override
  98:   mediaResolver: myResolver,     // optional; business handle (editor still needs it too)
  99:   permission: WenzEditorPermission.edit, // read/comment/edit command policy
 100: );
 101: ```
 102: 
 103: State accessors: `document`, `selection`, `compositionState`, `canUndo`,
 104: `canRedo`, `lastChangedBlockIds` (incremental-rebuild signal),
 105: `revisionModeEnabled`, `revisionAuthorId`, `revisionAuthorName`, `hasFocus`,
 106: `requestFocus()`, `permission`, `canRead`, `canComment`, `canEdit`.
 107: 
 108: Typed command surface (sample): `insertText`, `deleteBackward`, `deleteForward`,
 109: `deleteSelection`, `enter`, `moveCaretForward/Backward/Vertical/ByWord`,
 110: `moveCaretToBlockBoundary`, `moveCaretToDocumentBoundary`, `selectAll`,
 111: `formatText`, `clearStyle`, `setLink`, `autoLinkUrls`, `toggleRemark`, `setBlockType`,
 112: `setAlignment`, `indent`, `outdent`, `toggleTodo`, `toggleQuote`,
 113: `setCodeLanguage`, `indentCodeBlock`, `insertBlocks`, `replaceBlocks`,
 114: `setCalloutVariant`, `updateCalloutBlock`, `updateImageBlock`, `insertFile`,
 115: `updateFileBlock`, `insertBlockEmbed`,
 116: `setBlockAnchor`, `setRevisionMode`, `insertRevisionText`,
 117: `markDeletionRevision`, `markFormatRevision`, `acceptRevision`,
 118: `rejectRevision`,
 119: `insertTable` + the table structure family, `selectTableRow/Column`/
 120: `selectTable`.
 121: 
 122: `insertText` applies URL auto-linking by default for `http(s)://` and `www.`
 123: tokens, and can opt out per call with `applyAutoLinkUrls: false`.
 124: When revision mode is enabled, typed insert/delete/format helpers route through
 125: revision commands and create inline `revisionIds` plus top-level `revisions`.
 126: `WenzLinkEditDialog` / `showWenzLinkEditDialog` provide the reusable Material
 127: link-edit popup used by the example toolbar; an empty result clears the link.
 128: 
 129: Callbacks (fire synchronously before `notifyListeners`):
 130: 
 131: - `onChanged(RichTextDocument doc)`
 132: - `onSelectionChanged(DocumentSelection? selection)`
 133: - `onCommandExecuted(EditorCommand command, ChangeSet change)`
